Cell["\<\
We need to generate 10 \[Mu]s duration pulses at 100 Hz. When the Symmetry is \
set to 50% (the default) then we get a pulse which is 5 ms long. So to get a \
10 \[Mu]s duration pulse we need to set the symmetry to 0.1 %.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.948387134737574*^9, 3.948387222021473*^9}, {
  3.9483872645687447`*^9, 3.948387289858119*^9}, {3.948387378960919*^9, 
  3.948387462678856*^9}, {3.948387503567731*^9, 
  3.948387505353805*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"79257337-b026-4520-b3e7-\
2c97cee98fe3"],

