Cell["Delay Estimate", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.948381500096589*^9, 
  3.948381505509406*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6bbf18a1-90ea-4148-894d-\
6c96e55177a2"],

Cell["\<\
We can manually estimate the delay between the 50 mm and 100 mm microphone \
positions by using the function Manipulate[].
Move the sliders until the red (50mm) signals initial peak overlays the blue \
(100mm) one (click on + button on right side of slider to get fine \
adjustment):\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.948381510431205*^9, 3.94838155759262*^9}, {
  3.94838852141616*^9, 3.94838858308457*^9}, {3.979833149106933*^9, 
