Cell["\<\
Note that in order to avoid the initial spikes in the data caused by the \
current pulse sent to the speaker being picked up by the microphone we \
omitted the first 7500 samples (i.e., 300 \[Mu]s).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97982854829216*^9, 3.979828603404907*^9}, {
  3.9798287039566183`*^9, 3.979828771981181*^9}, {3.9798295642341137`*^9, 
