Cell["\<\
Note the order in which the three plots are plotted. This ordering ensures \
that the red dots (the data) appear above the black lines. We have also \
improved the look of the plot by using bold and larger fonts on each axis. \
This is now a publication quality plot.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9483857076121893`*^9, 3.9483857564109297`*^9}, {
  3.948388702529895*^9, 
  3.948388773918428*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"42376bda-42f1-48cb-bc82-\
04dc6028bc9f"],

Cell["\<\
What does the slope of this line tell us. Well, its reciprocal is our least \
squares estimate of the speed of sound!
Lets determine it:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9483852229944887`*^9, 3.9483852704108067`*^9}, {
  3.948385936584395*^9, 
  3.948385939646605*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d231c37b-ef5d-4a4a-8927-\
57131b84777d"],

