Cell["\<\
Notice that the exponent, b, of the fitted power function model is near -1. \
In other words the sound amplitude rolls off as the inverse of distance.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.92402721201856*^9, 3.9240272468980913`*^9}, {
  3.924027362417857*^9, 3.924027388865711*^9}, {3.948653826317895*^9, 
  3.948653831401947*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"aea80941-536c-4a66-9d42-\
1385a2fe5124"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Lets refit the data but now we fix the exponent at -1. In other words lets \
fit the model:\namplitude ",
